WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Minimize keeps the app running

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Super + Z sends a window into its Fireball slot

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The dock grows as windows arrive; Burn away hides it

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Move near the edge to reveal the dock

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Click a slot to restore its window

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Restoring all windows empties the dock and it disappears

